  "description": "NetToolsKit.MessageBus.RabbitMq provides RabbitMQ transport adapter for MessageBus.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t• Connection pooling and channel management\n\t\t\t• Resilient publish/subscribe with automatic reconnection\n\t\t\t• Configurable retry policies and dead-letter queues (DLQ)\n\t\t\t• Exchange/queue/binding configuration via fluent API\n\t\t\t• Prefetch control and batch acknowledgment\n\n\t\t\tIdeal for high-throughput microservices requiring reliable RabbitMQ messaging.",
